    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> XCOM + Esports + management simulator = Esport Tactics</h2><br><br>Control every move your players make while calculating the risk of charging across the field, or camp and wait for your opponent to drop their guard. 5 Classes and many unique features different for each player. All set in a XCOM-style field with turn-based action. Or simulate each match if you just want to manage the team<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1972980/extras/MoveShootRange.PNG?t=1713601794\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Your Team In-between Each Match.</h2> <br><br>Choose what stat to focus on improving. Hire a free agent if your roster isn't holding up. Sign sponsors to earn money from each match you played, get better ranking, get better sponsors. Sell players you aren't using to other teams, or sell your veteran player so you can scoop up the youth talent. Build your brand. Its all up to you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1972980/extras/0ddf2d1d8a480cc54d64e1f94e960f37.avif?t=1713601794\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> XCOM + Esports + management simulator = Esport Tactics</h2><br><br>Control every move your players make while calculating the risk of charging across the field, or camp and wait for your opponent to drop their guard. 5 Classes and many unique features different for each player. All set in a XCOM-style field with turn-based action. Or simulate each match if you just want to manage the team<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1972980/extras/MoveShootRange.PNG?t=1713601794\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage Your Team In-between Each Match.</h2> <br><br>Choose what stat to focus on improving. Hire a free agent if your roster isn't holding up. Sign sponsors to earn money from each match you played, get better ranking, get better sponsors. Sell players you aren't using to other teams, or sell your veteran player so you can scoop up the youth talent. Build your brand. Its all up to you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1972980/extras/0ddf2d1d8a480cc54d64e1f94e960f37.avif?t=1713601794\" /></div>",
